\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  \cf0  Master, come and stay with us,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and make us feel strong in our faith
\par What ever we do today
\par Let it be done so truthfully,
\par that we shall become yours only,
\par and make us your congregation.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2.  Gracefully come and help us
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0  from all walks of life of us now.
\par You know how feeble we are,
\par  With lots of enemies around.
\par  Jesus, come and be our helper,
\par  Give us your life everlasting.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

